ont-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}.mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{border-left:10px solid #b32424;background-color:#fee7e6}.mw-parser-output .ambox-delete{border-left:10px solid #b32424}.mw-parser-output .ambox-content{border-left:10px solid #f28500}.mw-parser-output .ambox-style{border-left:10px solid #fc3}.mw-parser-output .ambox-move{border-left:10px solid #9932cc}.mw-parser-output .ambox-protection{border-left:10px solid #a2a9b1}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image{border:none;padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-imageright{border:none;padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:52px}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:0 10%}}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .ambox{display:none!important}}</style><table class="box-问题条目 plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content ambox-multiple&#95;issues compact-ambox" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/40px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/120px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="40" data-file-height="40" /></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span"><div class="multiple-issues-text mw-collapsible"><b>本條目存在以下問題</b>，請協助<b><a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit">改善本條目</a></b>或在<b><a href="/wiki/Talk:%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD" title="Talk:成語">討論頁</a></b>針對議題發表看法。
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r88027378" /><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r94488332" /><table class="box-Cleanup plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-style ambox-style" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Edit-clear.svg/40px-Edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Edit-clear.svg/120px-Edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b>可能需要<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B8%85%E7%90%86" title="Wikipedia:清理">清理</a>，以符合維基百科<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C" title="Wikipedia:格式手冊">品質標準</a>。</b><span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2025年2月6日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請儘量協助<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit">改善這篇條目</a>，詳情請參見<a href="/wiki/Talk:%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD" title="Talk:成語">討論頁</a>。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r88027378" /><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r94488332" /><table class="box-Expand&#95;language plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-notice" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/60px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="50" height="17" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/120px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="60" data-file-height="20" /></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b>可參照<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chengyu" class="extiw" title="en:Chengyu">英語維基百科</a>相應條目來擴充</b>。<span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2025年2月6日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>若您熟悉來源語言和主題，請協助<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%88%E5%88%99" class="mw-redirect" title="Wikipedia:翻譯守則">參考外語維基百科擴充條目</a>。請勿直接提交機械翻譯，也不要翻譯不可靠、低品質內容。依<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%9C%A8%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%86%85%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9" title="Wikipedia:在維基百科內複製內容">版權協議</a>，譯文需<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81#翻譯文章" class="mw-redirect" title="Wikipedia:編輯摘要">在編輯摘要註明來源</a>，或於討論頁頂部標記<code>{{<a href="/wiki/Template:Translated_page" title="Template:Translated page">Translated page</a>}}</code>標籤。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r88027378" /><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r94488332" /><table class="box-Refimprove plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Tango-nosources.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/60px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="45" height="45" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/120px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></a></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b>需要補充更多<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:列明來源">來源</a></b>。<span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2025年2月6日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請協助補充多方面<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:可靠來源">可靠來源</a>以<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit">改善這篇條目</a>，<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81" class="mw-redirect" title="Wikipedia:可供查證">無法查證</a>的內容可能會因為<a href="/wiki/Template:Fact" class="mw-redirect" title="Template:Fact">異議提出</a>而被移除。<br />致使用者：請搜尋一下條目的標題（來源搜尋：<span class="plainlinks"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?&amp;as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD%22">"成語"</a> &#8212; <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?q=%22%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD%22">網頁</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=&amp;as_src=-newswire+-wire+-presswire+-PR+-press+-release+-wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD%22">新聞</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//books.google.com/books?&amp;as_brr=0&amp;as_pub=-icon&amp;q=%22%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD%22">書籍</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//scholar.google.com/scholar?&amp;q=%22%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD%22">學術</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;safe=off&amp;q=%22%E6%88%90%E8%AF%AD%22">圖像</a></span>），以檢查網路上是否存在該主題的更多可靠來源（<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:可靠來源">判定指引</a>）。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
</div></div><span class="hide-when-compact"></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
